      code: "List<String> names = List.of(\"Jay\",\"Ana\",\"Bob\",\"Zoe\");\n\nList<String> result = names.stream()\n    .filter(n -> n.length() > 3)\n    .map(String::toUpperCase)\n    .sorted()\n    .collect(Collectors.toList());\n// [ANA, JAY, ZOE]",
